&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSBOINze4oJ__BIP3fZM5sYfrNKTbsdqb305Bm_vZdIYw&oe=6AFC7B74"}, {"file_name": "Trailer 2.png", "id": "1339585267486548", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_1339585270819881_5752003200383625231_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ChYgyp_t9dUQ7kNvwFFv-Vl&_nc_oc=AdppWN_wv5RE3TWW-9nPA4aqxKJibsCrdTrHN8j1xSIbemVtLZJVGLKth0l_BeuGcHM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT6HXo52frAFSSRINbxEhGFVi-mf6ar-TDISiKraPijDg&oe=6AFC700D"}, {"file_name": "Trailer 4.png", "id": "25299459349722807", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_25299459369722805_1875565800982623569_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VKmlYhCRZxsQ7kNvwGsCPhq&_nc_oc=Adr62fEi8TPjcLn9SYira2OmhCUsfFs4aFzcvORKdrd6Ei-ntYRUs_nYDbY5ZwKWj1U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRcdeasnbhEMflcoTibxNuXYhoVa-hZi2klTpwgRgVFPw&oe=6AFC7C8F"}, {"file_name": "Trailer 5.png", "id": "2038404890292862", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819859_2038404893626195_50283950361106217_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9K6Tv400yWgQ7kNvwFlLH91&_nc_oc=Adpk7bxnwI-Mdd6it5TSICovi0ELhgY7mNJegZ8T9xC8twSrKD3Ju3CZLP0F0Pkf7Bc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRe4i_HDS0y-g1bU1Kq6d6WvPjg-WNw56PhiwdZutLCCg&oe=6AFC7477"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer poster.png", "id": "1340193764070608", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_1340193767403941_2787865297931591383_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ygHBxA5wCxYQ7kNvwGCXRYh&_nc_oc=AdrveaCMCNm8F3yqbUg3Ts5KiPN7SkgVUavwb7kq_hiUZj4-dqyl154PXU6JXrVpEz8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQxCdvejDllQnd3iknPx-cVS0yYA_nhJe0x0zX0Xceacw&oe=6AFC8B58"}, "display_name": "Plank n' Kitty", "keywords": [], "long_description": "## Plank n' Kitty\n\nGran\u2019s cat has wandered off and ended up at the end of a plank high above the city!\n\nStep through the doorway into a virtual cartoon world, walk the plank, rescue the kitty, and bring it safely back to gran.\n\n**Plank \u2019n Kitty is a mixed-reality experience, not a game.**  \nIt\u2019s designed to be fun, approachable, and best enjoyed with friends or family taking turns.  \nEveryone can join in by watching the action on TV or mobile.\n\n---\n\n## What makes it different\n\n- **Two-way mixed-reality portal**  \n  A door in your room opens into a virtual world \u2014 and from the plank, the door becomes a portal back into your real room.\n\n- **Exciting but not extreme**  \n  High enough to feel thrilling, without pushing into fear-only territory. Accessible fun for everybody.\n\n- **Configurable play space**  \n  Preview and adjust the size and position to fit your room before you start.\n\n- **Perfect for group play**  \n  Take turns, watch reactions, and enjoy it together.\n\n- **TV casting support**  \n  Cast to a TV so everyone can see what the player sees.\n\n---\n\n## Device Support\nSupports mixed reality on Quest 2, Quest 3, and Quest Pro.  \nPassthrough quality varies by device.\n\n---\n\n## Comfort Note\nThis experience involves real-world movement.  \nThis is a **room-scale mixed reality experience** and adapts to your available space.  \nMake sure your area is clear before playing.", "short_description": "Gran\u2019s cat has gone missing. Step through the portal, walk the plank high above the city, and bring the kitty home. A fun, approachable mixed-reality experience made for friends, families, and party play."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.rayamedia.com/home/plank-n-kitty-privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rayamedia", "s